# demo_repo/ must be its own git repo for the Verifier's `git worktree`
# sandboxing to work (AGENTS.md Section 7), but that .git is deliberately
# not committed here - see devsetup.py. It's created on demand locally by
# conftest.py / graph.py, so ignore it rather than embed a nested repo.
demo_repo/.git/
